  "name": "Catnip Hookah",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Price</strong> 70 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 5 lbs.</p>\n<p>This intricate glass instrument has a long stem which carries filtered smoke to the user. It is a popular instrument amongst desert dwelling catfolk who will use it with various catnip substances after long days in the heat.</p>\n<p>When a dose of catnip is used with a catnip hookah, the dose can be consumed by up to 4 creatures. Using a hookah requires 1 minute. Other smokable substances (tobacco, etc.) may be consumed using this hookah subject to GM discretion.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/adventuring-gear#toc3\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
